        <attribute name="Name" id="2812" net="1">
          <![CDATA[Handmade leather shoes]]>
          <graphics count="0"/>
        </attribute>
        <attribute name="Description" id="2813" net="1">
          <![CDATA[Making a pair of handmade welted leather shoes: foot measuring, building up a last with trial-shoe fittings capped at two reworks (inhibitor arc), pattern cutting, clicking and closing the upper in parallel with insole and sole preparation, lasting with toe relasting, three days resting on the last (inhibitor, read and reset arcs), hand welting, sole stitching, heel building with pitch rework, edge inking and burnishing, polishing and pair matching, and a customer fitting with heel-grip and stretching alterations.]]>
          <graphics count="0"/>
        </attribute>
        <graphics count="0"/>
      </metadata>
